    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people feel that way but it feels different for me. it's not just being lonely or lost... it's more like i'm already gone. like i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the part that's already vanished. there's no point in \"coping\" with something that doesn't even exist anymore. it just feels like the wind is eventually going to blow me into nothingness anyway.",
