    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to talk to professionals about this because they always try to pull you back to the shore. they want to tie you down to something real. but what if the nothingness is the only thing that actually fits? what if drifting away is just the natural conclusion of everything? it feels so much more peaceful to just stop fighting the current and let it take me.",
